flowchart TD
    %% End-to-End Customer Journey Flowchart

    START([Customer Arrives at /auth/login]) --> LOGIN_FORM[/Enter Registered Email & Password/]
    LOGIN_FORM --> AUTH_GATE{Authenticate Credentials}

    AUTH_GATE -- Invalid Credentials --> ATTEMPT_CNT{Failed Attempts >= 5?}
    ATTEMPT_CNT -- Yes --> LOCKOUT[Set Status LOCKED for 15 mins]
    ATTEMPT_CNT -- No --> FLASH_ERR[Increment Failed Counter & Flash Error Message]
    LOCKOUT --> ACCESS_DENIED([Show Account Locked Error Notice])
    FLASH_ERR --> LOGIN_FORM

    AUTH_GATE -- Valid & Active --> SESSION_ROT[Regenerate Session ID: request.changeSessionId]
    SESSION_ROT --> LOAD_DASH[Load Customer Dashboard: /customer/dashboard]

    LOAD_DASH --> DASH_VIEW{Customer Action Selection}

    %% 1. Overview
    DASH_VIEW -->|View Portfolio| VIEW_PORTFOLIO[Display Accounts: Savings, Current Balances & Recent 5 Txns]
    VIEW_PORTFOLIO --> DASH_VIEW

    %% 2. Fund Transfer Flow
    DASH_VIEW -->|Initiate Transfer| TRANSFER_FORM[/Input Beneficiary Acc, Amount, Remarks/]
    TRANSFER_FORM --> PRE_VALIDATE{Client & Basic Validation}
    PRE_VALIDATE -- Invalid --> TRANSFER_FORM
    PRE_VALIDATE -- Valid --> CONFIRM_MODAL[Display Transfer Confirmation Screen]
    CONFIRM_MODAL --> CONFIRM_CHOICE{Customer Confirms?}
    CONFIRM_CHOICE -- Cancel --> DASH_VIEW
    CONFIRM_CHOICE -- Submit POST --> EXEC_TRANSFER[Service: Concurrency Lock + DB Transaction]
    EXEC_TRANSFER --> TRANSFER_RESULT{Transfer Result}
    TRANSFER_RESULT -- Success --> FLASH_TXN_OK[Flash 'Transfer Successful' & PRG Redirect]
    TRANSFER_RESULT -- Failure --> FLASH_TXN_ERR[Flash Business Error e.g. Insufficient Funds & PRG Redirect]
    FLASH_TXN_OK --> LOAD_DASH
    FLASH_TXN_ERR --> TRANSFER_FORM

    %% 3. History Flow
    DASH_VIEW -->|Transaction History| HIST_FILTER[/Select Date Range, Txn Type, Status, Search Query/]
    HIST_FILTER --> EXEC_QUERY[Query DAO with Pagination]
    EXEC_QUERY --> SHOW_STATEMENT[Render Paginated Statement Table]
    SHOW_STATEMENT --> DASH_VIEW

    %% 4. Banking Services: Loans
    DASH_VIEW -->|Apply for Loan| LOAN_FORM[/Input Desired Principal & Tenure in Months/]
    LOAN_FORM --> CALC_EMI[Compute Projected Monthly EMI using loan.interest_rate]
    CALC_EMI --> SUBMIT_LOAN[Submit Loan Application: Status PENDING]
    SUBMIT_LOAN --> FLASH_LOAN_OK[Flash 'Application Submitted' & PRG Redirect]
    FLASH_LOAN_OK --> DASH_VIEW

    %% 5. Banking Services: Fixed Deposit
    DASH_VIEW -->|Open Fixed Deposit| FD_FORM[/Select Account, Principal Amount, Tenure/]
    FD_FORM --> CALC_MATURITY[Compute Maturity Date & Returns using fd.interest_rate]
    CALC_MATURITY --> CONFIRM_FD{Confirm FD Creation?}
    CONFIRM_FD -- Yes --> EXEC_FD[Debit Account, Persist FD Record: Status ACTIVE]
    EXEC_FD --> FLASH_FD_OK[Flash 'FD Opened Successfully' & PRG Redirect]
    FLASH_FD_OK --> DASH_VIEW
    CONFIRM_FD -- No --> DASH_VIEW

    %% 6. Profile & Security
    DASH_VIEW -->|Profile Management| PROF_FORM[/View Profile, Edit Phone or Address/]
    PROF_FORM --> SAVE_PROF[Update User Profile & Flash Confirmation]
    SAVE_PROF --> DASH_VIEW

    DASH_VIEW -->|Change Password| PWD_FORM[/Input Current Password, New Password, Confirm New/]
    PWD_FORM --> VALID_PWD{Current Password Valid & New PWD Meets Complexity?}
    VALID_PWD -- No --> FLASH_PWD_ERR[Flash Password Error & Return to Form]
    VALID_PWD -- Yes --> HASH_PWD[Generate Salted BCrypt Hash & Update DB]
    HASH_PWD --> FLASH_PWD_OK[Flash 'Password Changed Successfully']
    FLASH_PWD_ERR --> PWD_FORM
    FLASH_PWD_OK --> DASH_VIEW

    %% 7. Logout
    DASH_VIEW -->|Logout| LOGOUT_ACTION[Invalidate HTTP Session]
    LOGOUT_ACTION --> REDIR_LOGIN([Redirect to /auth/login with Flash Message])
